WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.850
Stage 2 runs the same commands
with the production settings file.

2
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:08.550
The preflight passes only with the test
smoke test's evidence from another tenant.

3
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:10.846
Steps 1.1 to 1.5 run unchanged,

4
00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:16.937
then the tenant-wide app management
policy goes on, with its approved hash.

5
00:00:16.937 --> 00:00:21.663
On day thirty-one, the pilot's legacy
account is disabled, never deleted.

6
00:00:21.663 --> 00:00:25.281
Conditional Access is then
enforced one ring at a time,

7
00:00:25.281 --> 00:00:29.301
each after fourteen days of
sign-ins and the CISO's decision.

8
00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:32.938
The smoke test now expects the
outside sign-in to be blocked,

9
00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:35.388
with the message Microsoft Learn gives.

10
00:00:35.388 --> 00:00:37.777
For a week, the drift run checks daily,

11
00:00:37.777 --> 00:00:41.900
and a ring that blocks the wrong
thing goes back to report-only.
